    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "After Eric’s victory, @Alex Leebaw  has officially had enough. Loss after loss has pushed him to the breaking point.\n\nHe storms off stage right, heads straight for the parking area, jumps into his race car, fires it up, and angrily takes off. Safe to say, folks… never drive angry.",
      "message_id": "1541117344926011635"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "images/034.png",
      "alt": "Adventure illustration"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Meanwhile, back in the studio, @Ethan Eckert  stages a demonstration of his own, bragging about stealing money from PGR. But that pesky squirrel strikes again, snatching the briefcase and taking off. Ethan gives chase until Wolfgang appears and hunts him down. Terrified, Ethan jumps into his momma’s arms, and they speed away.",
      "message_id": "1541117604452892743"
    },
