      "alt": "Adventure illustration"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Omg, @Josh McKinney takes the brand new guitar he just won and hits the Rock over the head with it……but wait a minute, there’s @#6 Zachary Cato, @#6 Zachary Cato with the wet willy from behind. Down goes McKinney and the bell rings!!",
